#: src/inkfist/game.py:47
msgid ""
"For three hundred years the Wind Bell rang over the valley at dawn. Last "
"night it fell silent: the Warlord of Seven Winds stole it and fled to the "
"summit. Your master is too old for the climb. You are not."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:48
msgid ""
"Brigands guard the bamboo paths. Keep your guard up and strike when they "
"open theirs."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:49
msgid ""
"A rope bridge spans the gorge. The Bridge Keeper lets no one pass — he hits "
"hard, but slowly."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:50
msgid ""
"The rain monks serve the Warlord now. They read every strike. Hit them where "
"they do not guard."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:51
msgid ""
"Snow muffles every step. Shadows move faster than you — watch their hands."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:52
msgid ""
"The old temple burns. The Ember General waits among the ruins with his long "
"spear."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:53
msgid ""
"The summit. The wind howls, the sky cracks. The Bell is near — and so is the "
"Warlord."
msgstr ""

#: src/inkfist/game.py:54
msgid ""
"The Wind Bell rings over the valley again. Your master bows to you: the "
"student has become the teacher."
msgstr ""

